                            <comment id="477819" author="JIRAUSER60539" created="Fri, 27 Mar 2026 14:40:21 +0300"  >&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;%F0%9F%A4%96AITalepDe%C4%9Ferlendirmesi&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#129302; AI Talep De&#287;erlendirmesi&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Puan:&lt;/b&gt; 96/100 - &lt;font color=&quot;green&quot;&gt;BA&#350;ARILI&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;TalepDe%C4%9Ferlendirmesi&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Talep De&#287;erlendirmesi&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#304;ncelemekte oldu&#287;um &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.lcwaikiki.com/browse/TY-134316&quot; title=&quot;Backoffice E-Ticaret Kredi Kart&#305; &#304;adeleri &#304;&amp;#xE7;in &amp;quot;&#304;ade Bilgi Formu&amp;quot; Olu&#351;turma&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;TY-134316&quot;&gt;TY-134316&lt;/a&gt; numaral&#305; talep, operasyonel verimlili&#287;i art&#305;rmaya y&#246;nelik, teknik ve i&#351; gereksinimleri a&#231;&#305;s&#305;ndan olduk&#231;a olgunla&#351;m&#305;&#351; ve net bir taleptir. Mevcut manuel s&#252;recin otomatize edilmesi hedeflenmi&#351; olup, analiz detaylar&#305; geli&#351;tirme ekiplerinin eforlama yapabilmesi i&#231;in yeterli seviyededir.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;TalepDe%C4%9FerlendirmeRaporu%3ATY134316&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt;Talep De&#287;erlendirme Raporu: &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.lcwaikiki.com/browse/TY-134316&quot; title=&quot;Backoffice E-Ticaret Kredi Kart&#305; &#304;adeleri &#304;&amp;#xE7;in &amp;quot;&#304;ade Bilgi Formu&amp;quot; Olu&#351;turma&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;TY-134316&quot;&gt;TY-134316&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;1.Ba%C5%9Fl%C4%B1k%2FA%C3%A7%C4%B1klama%2FDilbilgisi&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Ba&#351;l&#305;k / A&#231;&#305;klama / Dilbilgisi&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Kategori:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;green&quot;&gt;Eksiksiz / Beklenenin &#220;zerinde&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;A&#231;&#305;klama:&lt;/b&gt; Ba&#351;l&#305;k talebi &#231;ok net &#246;zetliyor. Mevcut durum ve istenen durum ayr&#305;m&#305; yap&#305;larak sorunun kayna&#287;&#305; ve &#231;&#246;z&#252;m beklentisi profesyonel bir dille ifade edilmi&#351;.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&#304;yile&#351;tirme &#214;nerisi:&lt;/b&gt; Herhangi bir iyile&#351;tirme &#246;nerisi bulunmamaktad&#305;r.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;hr /&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;2.Ama%C3%A7veGerek%C3%A7e&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Ama&#231; ve Gerek&#231;e&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Kategori:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;blue&quot;&gt;Bekleneni Kar&#351;&#305;l&#305;yor&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;A&#231;&#305;klama:&lt;/b&gt; Talebin yap&#305;lma gerek&#231;esi (operasyonel verimlilik) ve i&#351; de&#287;eri net. Manuel s&#252;recin ortadan kald&#305;r&#305;lmas&#305; somut bir faydad&#305;r.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&#304;yile&#351;tirme &#214;nerisi:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Yan&#305;t s&#252;resini k&#305;saltmak&quot; hedefi i&#231;in say&#305;sal bir KPI (&#214;rn: &quot;&#304;ade dekontu taleplerine d&#246;n&#252;&#351; s&#252;resinin ortalama 2 saatten 5 dakikaya indirilmesi&quot;) eklenmesi, talebin ba&#351;ar&#305;s&#305;n&#305;n &#246;l&#231;&#252;lmesini kolayla&#351;t&#305;racakt&#305;r.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;hr /&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;3.KabulKriterleri&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Kabul Kriterleri&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Kategori:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;green&quot;&gt;Eksiksiz / Beklenenin &#220;zerinde&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;A&#231;&#305;klama:&lt;/b&gt; Kabul kriterleri son derece detayl&#305;; maskeleme kurallar&#305;, veri alanlar&#305;, tarih&#231;e y&#246;netimi ve hata durumlar&#305; (ba&#351;ar&#305;s&#305;z i&#351;lemler) tek tek maddelenmi&#351;. Test edilebilirli&#287;i y&#252;ksektir.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&#304;yile&#351;tirme &#214;nerisi:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Formun sadece T&#252;rk&#231;e mi yoksa &#304;ngilizce dil deste&#287;iyle mi olu&#351;turulaca&#287;&#305; netle&#351;tirilebilir (E&#287;er global m&#252;&#351;teriler varsa).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;hr /&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;4.GereksinimDetaylar%C4%B1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt;4. Gereksinim Detaylar&#305;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Kategori:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;green&quot;&gt;Eksiksiz / Beklenenin &#220;zerinde&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;A&#231;&#305;klama:&lt;/b&gt; Ekran konumu (path) ve butonun bulunaca&#287;&#305; sekme net olarak belirtilmi&#351;. PDF i&#231;eri&#287;inde bulunmas&#305; gereken ibareler ve kurumsal &#351;ablon vurgusu yeterlidir.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&#304;yile&#351;tirme &#214;nerisi:&lt;/b&gt; Herhangi bir iyile&#351;tirme &#246;nerisi bulunmamaktad&#305;r.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;hr /&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;5.%C4%B0%C5%9FKurallar%C4%B1veS%C3%BCre%C3%A7&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt;5. &#304;&#351; Kurallar&#305; ve S&#252;re&#231;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Kategori:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;green&quot;&gt;Eksiksiz / Beklenenin &#220;zerinde&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;A&#231;&#305;klama:&lt;/b&gt; KVKK uyumlulu&#287;u (maskeleme), belgenin hukuki niteli&#287;i (banka dekontu olmad&#305;&#287;&#305; vurgusu) ve veri kayna&#287;&#305; (MobileKspress) gibi kritik i&#351; kurallar&#305; netle&#351;tirilmi&#351;.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&#304;yile&#351;tirme &#214;nerisi:&lt;/b&gt; Herhangi bir iyile&#351;tirme &#246;nerisi bulunmamaktad&#305;r.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;hr /&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;6.%C4%B0%C5%9FEtkisiDe%C4%9Ferlendirmesi&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt;6. &#304;&#351; Etkisi De&#287;erlendirmesi&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Kategori:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;green&quot;&gt;Eksiksiz / Beklenenin &#220;zerinde&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;A&#231;&#305;klama:&lt;/b&gt; Se&#231;ilen etki t&#252;rleri (Deneyim &#304;yile&#351;tirme - Orta) ve di&#287;er d&#252;&#351;&#252;k etkili alanlar, talebin i&#231;eri&#287;i ile tam bir tutarl&#305;l&#305;k sergiliyor. Ger&#231;ek&#231;i bir de&#287;erlendirme yap&#305;lm&#305;&#351;.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&#304;yile&#351;tirme &#214;nerisi:&lt;/b&gt; Herhangi bir iyile&#351;tirme &#246;nerisi bulunmamaktad&#305;r.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;hr /&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;GenelDe%C4%9FerlendirmeveSonu%C3%A7&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt;Genel De&#287;erlendirme ve Sonu&#231;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Talep, kurumsal standartlara uygun, analizi iyi yap&#305;lm&#305;&#351; ve geli&#351;tirme s&#252;recine haz&#305;r bir durumdad&#305;r. &#214;zellikle kabul kriterlerinin detay seviyesi ve i&#351; kurallar&#305;ndaki KVKK hassasiyeti talebin kalitesini art&#305;rmaktad&#305;r. Belirtilen k&#252;&#231;&#252;k iyile&#351;tirme &#246;nerileri (KPI ve dil deste&#287;i) projenin raporlanmas&#305; a&#351;amas&#305;nda fayda sa&#287;layacakt&#305;r.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sonu&#231;:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;green&quot;&gt;BA&#350;ARILI&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Not:&lt;/b&gt; 60 ve &#252;zeri puan alan talepler BA&#350;ARILI, 60 alt&#305; puan alan talepler BA&#350;ARISIZ kabul edilir.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bu de&#287;erlendirme otomatik olarak AI taraf&#305;ndan olu&#351;turulmu&#351;tur.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
